      "revision": 1294819494,
      "text": "Rothmannia longiflora a tree to about 9 m (30 ft) height and native to tropical Africa, in the family Rubiaceae. It is noted for its white and purple trumpet-shaped flowers, which may exceed 25 cm (9.8 in) in length."
    },
